WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:12.651
"Come look at this thing," said Bat.

2
00:00:12.652 --> 00:00:14.588
"It is not a hat.

3
00:00:14.589 --> 00:00:16.822
It is not a box.

4
00:00:16.823 --> 00:00:20.373
It is not a rock," said Bat.

5
00:00:20.374 --> 00:00:22.173
"It is brown.

6
00:00:22.174 --> 00:00:23.676
It is hard.

7
00:00:23.677 --> 00:00:27.284
And it is small," said Bat.

8
00:00:27.285 --> 00:00:37.028
"Can you tell me what it is?"

9
00:00:37.029 --> 00:00:41.101
They all went into the barn.

10
00:00:41.102 --> 00:00:45.959
"The thing is over there," said Bat.

11
00:00:45.960 --> 00:00:49.614
They went to the spot.

12
00:00:49.615 --> 00:00:52.380
They looked at the thing.

13
00:00:52.381 --> 00:00:56.732
"You said the thing is brown," said Cow.

14
00:00:56.733 --> 00:01:02.892
"This thing is not brown."

15
00:01:02.893 --> 00:01:06.049
"You said the thing is hard.

16
00:01:06.050 --> 00:01:09.696
This thing is not hard," said Pig.

17
00:01:09.697 --> 00:01:13.995
"You said the thing is small," said Cat.

18
00:01:13.996 --> 00:01:15.549
"You are right.

19
00:01:15.550 --> 00:01:20.784
This thing is very small."

20
00:01:20.785 --> 00:01:28.205
Bat flew over.

21
00:01:28.206 --> 00:01:34.373
He looked at the thing again.

22
00:01:34.374 --> 00:01:39.946
"But where is the thing I saw?" said Bat.

23
00:01:39.947 --> 00:01:46.612
"I do not see it now."

